message: "If you use this repository in your research, please cite it using the metadata below."

title: "A Multi-Layered Defense Against Adversarial Attacks in Brain Tumor Classification: Implementation"

type: software

authors:
  - family-names: "Akbarnia"
    given-names: "Elahe"
    email: "elahe.akbarnia.edu@gmail.com"

abstract: >
  This repository provides an implementation of a multi-layered adversarial
  defense framework for brain tumor MRI classification. The implementation
  includes VGG16 transfer learning, FGSM and PGD adversarial attacks,
  feature squeezing defense, and adversarial training.

keywords:
  - "medical imaging"
  - "brain tumor classification"
  - "MRI"
  - "adversarial attacks"
  - "FGSM"
  - "PGD"
  - "feature squeezing"
  - "deep learning"
  - "medical AI"

